Looking at the compilation error, the issue is that `VAR_OUTPUT` declarations cannot have initializers in CODESYS ST. The `:INT := 0` and `:BOOL := FALSE` syntax in the output section is invalid.

```json
{"edits":[{"old":"VAR_OUTPUT
    elapsed : INT := 0;
    phase   : INT := 0;
    timeout : BOOL := FALSE;
END_VAR

VAR
    prev_startBtn : BOOL := FALSE;
END_VAR

VAR
    startRising : BOOL;
    prev_phase  : INT;
END_VAR", "new":"VAR_OUTPUT
    elapsed : INT;
    phase   : INT;
    timeout : BOOL;
END_VAR

VAR
    prev_startBtn : BOOL := FALSE;
    startRising   : BOOL;
    prev_phase    : INT;
END_VAR"}]}
```
